[{"id":"RAW_f37d5dd27b","title":"极致量化，近三千亿参数 Hy3 单卡即可部署","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwODU2OTQyNQ==&mid=2247498028&idx=1&sn=9b6f4f0d9eff9d2a6925f3860eb63665","date":"2026-07-14 16:56:00","oneSentenceSummary":"腾讯混元将 Hy3 模型进行 1bit 和 4bit 量化并适配 llama.cpp，使 295B 参数模型能在单卡或低资源设备上运行，同时保持接近满血性能。","summary":"腾讯混元团队针对社区对旗舰模型 Hy3（295B 参数）在资源受限设备上的运行需求，将其权重分别量化为 1bit（IQ1_M）和 4bit（Q4_K_M）并打包为 GGUF 格式，配合 llama.cpp 实现。1bit 版本将模型权重从约 598 GB 压缩至约 85.5 GiB，可在单张 96GB 推理显卡上运行；4bit 版本约 169.9 GiB，需两张推理卡。实验表明，4bit 版本在输出分布和实际任务（Agent 能力、多语言代码、工具调用、长文理解）上与原始 BF16 模型保持高度一致，掉点可接受；令人惊讶的是 1bit 版本在多数主流任务上表现同样稳健，仅小幅回落。此外，团队为 llama.cpp 开发了 MTP 投机解码补丁，开启后 1bit 版本解码速度提升约 50%，4bit 版本提升约 60%，接受率稳定在 60% 左右，交互体验流畅。文中还给出了模型和对应量化版本的 HuggingFace 下载链接以及补丁地址。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_f37d5dd27b.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"腾讯混元","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":5,"score":91},{"id":"RAW_2644b9479a","title":"Claude 的价值观如何随模型和语言变化","link":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-values-models-languages","date":"2026-07-14 01:08:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_2644b9479a.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Anthropic Research","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":14,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_8d3c23ecd3","title":"训推全开源：HyOCR-1.5 让端到端 OCR 大模型跑得更快、看得更准、功能更全","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwODU2OTQyNQ==&mid=2247498015&idx=1&sn=aa97c2dd942e4c50d2553cf922bc61bd","date":"2026-07-13 19:13:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_8d3c23ecd3.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"腾讯混元","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":18,"score":91},{"id":"RAW_e88491d1c7","title":"使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway 为多租户代理实现代表令牌交换 | Amazon Web Services","link":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/implement-on-behalf-of-token-exchange-for-multi-tenant-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-gateway/","date":"2026-07-13 17:27:40","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_e88491d1c7.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"AWS Artificial Intelligence","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":23,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_c7a89e8181","title":"从 Coder 到 Designer：电商团队数据研发的 Harness Engineering 实践","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NTczNzg2OA==&mid=2247510241&idx=1&sn=04d54633f1d91d27be6580eda8b503b2","date":"2026-07-14 18:08:00","oneSentenceSummary":"本文提出了一套面向电商数据研发的 Multi-Agent 系统方案，通过知识工程与 Harness Engineering 架构设计，解决 AI 在复杂任务中的稳定性与可追溯性问题，实现从「写代码」到「做设计」的范式转变。","summary":"文章详细阐述了阿里电商团队在 AI 数据研发领域的工程化实践，提出了「知识工程」与「Harness Engineering」两大核心框架。作者通过 Multi-Agent 协同工作流（7 Agent 顺序协作与反馈循环），结合人工 Gate 审批，解决了 NL2SQL 在垂直领域难以推广的痛点。文中深入探讨了如何将数研专家经验结构化、如何通过技能幻觉检测 Hook 和空间隔离机制保障 AI 稳定性，以及如何通过心跳机制实现 Agent 的自动化自我迭代。文章还展望了从单团队到跨团队的知识复用，以及从 NL2SQL 到 ChatBI 的全链路延伸。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_c7a89e8181.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"阿里技术","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":25,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_13f77f1da5","title":"x86 准备好迎接 ACE 了吗？","link":"https://chipsandcheese.com/p/is-x86-ready-to-ace-it","date":"2026-07-14 09:23:37","oneSentenceSummary":"文章解释了 x86 AMX 的新增 ACE 加速器扩展，详细介绍了其外积设计、数据类型灵活性以及与 ARM SME 的对比，并探讨了针对现代 AI 工作负载的平铺、量化和缩放支持。","summary":"本文深入剖析了 Intel 的 ACE (Accelerator-2) 规范，该规范基于现有的 AMX 瓦片矩阵乘法 (TMUL) 加速器，并增加了第二种通过外积指令运行的加速器类型。文章对比了 ACE 固定的 64 字节 x 16 行瓦片配置及其对 FP8、复数和块缩放寄存器的支持与 ARM 的可扩展矩阵扩展 (SME) 和 SME2 的区别，重点突出了向量长度灵活性、量化数据查找表处理以及缩放因子实现方面的差异。文章还探讨了平铺如何提高内存复用率，外积原语在 SVD 和 FFT 等线性代数内核中的作用，以及这些 ISA 扩展对未来 AI 工作负载（包括反量化、码本压缩和异构数据类型支持）的影响。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_13f77f1da5.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"Hacker News","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":15,"score":89},{"id":"RAW_d79e823036","title":"微软如何以企业级规模交付 AI 智能体","link":"https://blog.bytebytego.com/p/how-microsoft-ships-ai-agents-at","date":"2026-07-13 23:02:11","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_d79e823036.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"ByteByteGo Newsletter","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":17,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_90db8375f8","title":"正式开源！美团 LongCat-2.0 同步开放国产卡推理代码","link":"https://tech.meituan.com/2026/07/12/LongCat-2.0-Open-source.html","date":"2026-07-13 22:22:04","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_90db8375f8.json","topicTag":"other","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"美团 · 技术团队","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":7,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_1dd4550aa5","title":"让 Agent 按工程标准交付：AI Coding 下的质量关卡实践","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjU0NTI5OQ==&mid=2247607331&idx=1&sn=ec3edf771169512261e9519df5041c19","date":"2026-07-13 18:00:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_1dd4550aa5.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"百度Geek说","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":27,"score":89},{"id":"RAW_e7b35eef63","title":"让 Agent 成为音视频工作台：AI MediaKit CLI + Skill 发布","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247520810&idx=1&sn=d0fb295a9edfdcdb71d4cb70ecd80c15","date":"2026-07-13 18:00:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_e7b35eef63.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"字节跳动技术团队","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":12,"score":91},{"id":"RAW_a91a414388","title":"淘宝直播数字人 AgenticRL 实践：从 RLVR 到 MultiAgent RL","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNDEwNjk5OQ==&mid=2650544788&idx=1&sn=04119d3b590b121e87fe87142daa6529","date":"2026-07-13 16:29:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_a91a414388.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"大淘宝技术","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":34,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_656fa52278","title":"开放权重模型占比激增至 29% 的产出量，代币单价持平","link":"https://vercel.com/blog/ai-gateway-production-index-july-2026","date":"2026-07-13 15:00:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_656fa52278.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"Vercel News","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":6,"score":91},{"id":"RAW_c2fec5d26e","title":"当一个年轻人空降：改造腾讯混元的 300 天","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3Mjk1OTQ0Ng==&mid=2247537361&idx=1&sn=ad25131b3f2976b44dd5e884e8775d97","date":"2026-07-13 21:55:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_c2fec5d26e.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"晚点LatePost","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":39,"score":91},{"id":"RAW_acb7b04876","title":"鸿蒙为何选中一家世界模型「狂想者」？拆解极顶数创的 AI 3D 底牌","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3MzI4MjgzMw==&mid=2651044179&idx=1&sn=c48e11247664eac72f69339baa6a86ea","date":"2026-07-14 10:31:00","oneSentenceSummary":"文章剖析极顶数创凭借自研 3D 大模型与鸿蒙深度适配，让 V2Fun 将 3D 建模简化为拍照即生成，并构建起从资产到世界模型的完整链路。","summary":"文章详细阐述了极顶数创旗下 V2Fun 如何通过 AI 3D 生成技术降低创作门槛。移动端 V2Fun 鸿蒙原生 App 让用户仅需拍摄或上传照片，即可在几十秒内得到高还原度的 3D 模型，并支持 GLB、3MF 等标准格式导出用于 3D 打印；Web 工作台则提供 AI 图像、建模、材质、动画等完整管线，实现从概念到专业级资产的全链路生产。文章还深入介绍了团队的技术突破，包括 VAE+DiT 架构、几何 Token 化的最小充分证据框架以及稀疏 3D 记忆库，使模型在多视角下保持结构精度、纹理一致性和高分辨率贴图。最后，文章阐明了极顶数创的长期愿景 —  — 以 3D 实体为骨架、动作控制为血肉，构建可编辑、可交互、可推演的全功能世界模型，并展望在工业制造、具身智能、仿真训练等场景的广泛应用。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_acb7b04876.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"机器之心","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":25,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_0da2c5b25f","title":"AI 越会回答，人为什么越需要深度思考？复旦发布 2026 人文社科智能发展蓝皮书","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3MzI4MjgzMw==&mid=2651044179&idx=2&sn=41f75476ca9dadd16a7d0badf7c945f9","date":"2026-07-14 10:31:00","oneSentenceSummary":"AI 的快速发展让深度思考与人文社科的判断责任更加关键，复旦蓝皮书探讨 AI 与人文社会科学的双向融合，强调深度思考在研究、治理与证据链保留中的不可替代性。","summary":"文章深入剖析了大模型在信息处理、论文写作、决策支持等场景的普及对人文社会科学的冲击，并提出 AI 与人文社科正从单向赋能转向双向融合。作者指出，AI 只能高效生成内容，却无法真正理解情境、价值与因果，因此深度思考、情境组织、经验迁移与价值判断仍是人类不可替代的核心能力。文章进一步提出 STRIDES 框架，要求在研究全过程中保留完整的假设、数据、代码、审查意见等环节，以防止自动化带来的可信度危机；同时区分代理型与辅助型 AI 嵌入模式，强调人在关键决策环节必须拥有介入、纠偏和解释权，防止责任蒸发。最后，蓝皮书呼吁在治理层面建立系统化的风险评估、运行监测与问责机制，使原则转化为可执行的程序，并强调科研产出应超越论文数量，关注数据、工具、规范、人才与协作机制的长期可运行性。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_0da2c5b25f.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"机器之心","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":24,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_26a1ff2178","title":"Datasette 在 GitHub 上的代码频率图","link":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/13/datasette-code-frequency/#atom-everything","date":"2026-07-14 05:45:27","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_26a1ff2178.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Simon Willison's Weblog","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":1,"score":83},{"id":"RAW_fb9107a5da","title":"智能体 RAG：让智能体去搜索","link":"https://towardsdatascience.com/agentic-rag-let-the-agent-search/","date":"2026-07-14 00:30:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_fb9107a5da.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Towards Data Science","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":7,"score":87},{"id":"RAW_abbe17a6bc","title":"Agent 专用搜索登顶 Product Hunt，Token 更省搜得更准","link":"https://www.qbitai.com/2026/07/449327.html","date":"2026-07-13 23:15:01","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_abbe17a6bc.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"量子位","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":16,"score":86},{"id":"RAW_47561ddbbc","title":"上下文腐化：为何 Claude Code 会话会衰退，以及如何管控","link":"https://towardsdatascience.com/governed-context-managing-context-rot-in-claude-code/","date":"2026-07-13 23:00:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_47561ddbbc.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Towards Data Science","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":16,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_07b093995a","title":"在两个世界里构建模型：从潜变量到行为信号","link":"https://towardsdatascience.com/building-models-in-two-worlds-from-latent-constructs-to-behavioral-signals/","date":"2026-07-13 21:30:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/07/RAW_07b093995a.json","topicTag":"other","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Towards 